- Removed SQUIRREL spec + registry entry (import_pets.py) and squirrel/
  glimmerwing entries (pets.json). Squirrel's sprite wasn't up to
  standard; Glimmerwing never had a spec at all.
- Mossback source path corrected: Frog/ -> ToxicFrog/ (real pack's
  actual top-level folder name).
- Tidewhelp source path corrected: Otter/ -> otter_sprite_pack/ (same
  issue, re-supplied pack checked and confirmed NOT a different pack --
  same filenames, same 200x200 frames, already right-facing).
