  combined source packs (not just reading the specs): every frame count
  matches the previously-supplied manifest.json exactly across Mossback/
  Tidewhelp/Skelly/Imp/Dragonling/Mimic. Dragonling's black-recolor
  output pixel-checked directly -- confirms the common tier already IS
  'Black Dragonling', no separate PetDef ever needed.
